[[63,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The following operations must be carried out before dismantling the component:</p><ul></ul></aside>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Use the tool (1a) to release the trim (1b) from the housing.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/770.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></th><th><p>Description</p></th><th><p>Code</p></th><th><p>Function</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Knife</p></td><td><p>1.878.077.000</p></td><td><p>Removing rear pillar cover</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the bolt and remove the trim.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/1239.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Tighten the bolt and fit the trim in place.</p><p>- Connect the battery leads.</p>"]]